    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the garden, where only the crunchiest survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Veggie Brawl is a fast-paced, no-frills multiplayer party game for 2 to 10 players. It\u2019s a full-blown vegetable food fight where friendships are tested, dignity is lost, and the losers? Let\u2019s just say\u2026 they\u2019re getting chopped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no farming mechanics. No recipes. No serious strategies. Just three rounds of unfiltered chaos where you chuck cucumbers, slap tomatoes, and try not to get turned into a side dish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re hosting game night or just need a good laugh, Veggie Brawl delivers quick, deliciously stupid fun for you and your produce-flinging pals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502880/extras/420cb28e9dd63de97708b08f1cfe8172.avif?t=1745929658\" data-has-big width=800 height=532 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2e3b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t<strong>\u2022\tMultiplayer Madness</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No solo mode. No bots. Just you, your friends, and a whole lot of badly-behaved vegetables.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t<strong>\u2022\tZero Brainpower Required</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you can throw, dodge, and scream at your monitor, you\u2019re already halfway to greatness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t<strong>\u2022\tFast Rounds, Faster Regrets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each match is over in minutes\u2014just enough time to ruin a friendship or two.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t<strong>\u2022\tPerfect for Parties</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loud, dumb, and dangerously addictive. Ideal for streamers, sleepovers, and passive-aggressive rivalries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t<strong>\u2022\tUnreasonably Dramatic Produce</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From a zen broccoli trying to \u201cblend in,\u201d to a tomato who\u2019s fully embraced his ketchup destiny, each character brings their own flavor to the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502880/extras/3fd26c5626256acaed0789d0d079dd9a.avif?t=1745929658\" data-has-big width=800 height=532 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2e3b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tagline:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You\u2019re not getting tossed in a salad. Not today.</i></p>",
