paragraph\" >\t<strong>\u2022\tUnreasonably Dramatic Produce</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From a zen broccoli trying to \u201cblend in,\u201d to a tomato who\u2019s fully embraced his ketchup destiny, each character brings their own flavor to the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502880/extras/3fd26c5626256acaed0789d0d079dd9a.avif?t=1745929658\" data-has-big width=800 height=532 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2e3b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tagline:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You\u2019re not getting tossed in a salad. Not today.</i></p>",
    "short_description": "Veggie Brawl is a multiplayer game where 10 vegetables fight in 3 rounds. The last veggie standing wins, while the 9 losers turn into a salad! Each veggie has unique abilities, and players must strategize to survive. Only the strongest veggie avoids becoming a salad!",
